# Rename this file to `.env` and replace the placeholder values with your actual Supabase credentials and a randomly generated secret for game sessions.
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-url.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-url.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

## For security, the service role key should only be used in server-side code (e.g. Vercel functions) and never exposed in client-side code. In this project, it's used in the Vercel function at `src/api/saveScore.ts` to authenticate with Supabase when saving scores.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-key
GAME_SESSION_SECRET=your-randomly-generated-secret